<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss bonds' price surge continues for third day.</title>
<headline>Swiss bonds' price surge continues for third day.</headline>
<text>
<p>1500 GMT - Swiss bonds ended higher once again. Dec Conf futures hit new contract highs for the third day in a row. On a continuation basis the Conf was at its highs for the year, bolstered by demand in the long end. * Dec Conf futures 53 basis points higher at 115.65.</p>
<p>(Full details/background follow)</p>
